      "content": "that's a bit too vague for what i need. i don't need a textbook definition, i need the actual \"weak spots.\" like, specifically on things like wealth redistribution or climate mandates—where is the logic actually broken? if you're being a real analyst, you should be able to point out the specific contradictions that make their platform unsustainable. give it to me straight.",
